---
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Socials from "@/components/Socials.astro";
import { SITE } from "@/config";
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title={`About | ${SITE.title}`}
  description={`About ${SITE.author} — ${SITE.bio}`}
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 pb-12">
    <article class="prose mt-8 max-w-3xl">
      <h1>About</h1>

      {/*
        About-page image — swap the file in `public/`.
        The filename is SITE.aboutImage in src/config.ts (default: about-image.jpg).
        A landscape photo works best; it renders full width at 16:9.
      */}
      <img
        src={`/${SITE.aboutImage}`}
        alt={SITE.author}
        width="1200"
        height="675"
        class="aspect-video w-full rounded-md object-cover"
        loading="lazy"
      />

      <p>I'm an AI Engineer interested in the systems and tools that make AI useful.</p>

      <p>
        I studied mechanical engineering and spent three years working in the water
        sector. I started programming in 2019, and my curiosity eventually took me from
        software into microcontrollers, IoT, processors, GPUs, and the systems behind
        modern computing. Building an ESP32 based smart greenhouse during college was
        one of the projects that really got me interested in understanding what happens
        underneath the software.
      </p>

      <p>
        Today, I work across the AI engineering stack, from data and models to
        infrastructure, tooling, and the applications built on top of them. I enjoy
        understanding how the pieces fit together, but also building things and seeing
        them work in the real world.
      </p>

      <p>This blog is where I document that journey.</p>

      <p>
        I'll write about AI, machine learning, data, systems, programming,
        infrastructure, and the occasional project that I find interesting enough to
        build.
      </p>

      <p>I don't have a grand plan for the blog.</p>

      <p>I'm mostly here to follow my curiosity and write down what I learn along the way.</p>

      <hr />

      <p>Find me on:</p>
    </article>

    <div class="mt-4">
      <Socials />
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
